{"v":4,"catch":"小 Magi 的大冒險開始了！","desc":"Arcanion： Magi Side Story\n的故事發生在 Tale of Magi 事件之後，Magi 正在尋找她的雙胞胎 Sorc。她發現周遭環境發生了一些怪事，導致當地居民變得暴戾，因此 Magi 前去調查原因，希望也能找到她的雙胞胎。\n\n-關於遊戲\n在復古遊戲風格的遊戲中遊玩六個關卡，改良了 Magi 的操作機制，使其操控性更強。有兩種額外的可玩模式：Sorc Mode 和 Boss Attack。\n\n此遊戲是由Maker系列中專門製作動作遊戲的軟體「Pixel Game Maker MV」所製作。此遊戲系列均能在Nintendo Switch™上遊玩。","publisher":"Gotcha Gotcha Games","release":"2025-03-27","genres":["街機","動作","射擊"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c14f272d7c5d3ab864fa0afa1b869ad6c34c825c5a351ec04201a482731a1075.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8fe68e1933bade212c7e0fa4a06cf5fa9c6219e3071b05d8e9f93e0b073ed88a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4d4a4015f653b29869faf560841ec74138d4ba59bce03e985df7bd61c8706fbe.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8ec786efc4f709675fec662bfe8f6fa27efeda1566615189e1f6e01f67660979.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/facf0a0bb144b5c0fb02ac5d336cc98ddadf378869772e4d4109da9ab0ddbe7f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c5e19daf3c17bf0627ee18e7f4d220cb1ee930b9ba55f0cf370631790550743c.jpg"],"titleId":"01007df021d12000","dlc":[],"vids":["oGnnKSETr3o"]}